# Test of the Healer (Q226), a second class-change test for knights, clerics and oracles, played
# by a level 39 Cleric holding the 100000 adena Gupu asks (and more): Bandellos starts it and pays
# the level 39 set's Dimensional Diamonds; Perrin sends the traveller to Tatoma (called by his
# dialog, which this scenario leaves standing; the scenario's own Tatoma is the one slain);
# Allana; Gupu takes the 100000 adena for Windy's picture, Windy swaps it for the pebbles and Gupu
# for the golden statue; Sorius's order for Daurin, who calls the Leto lizardman leader; the
# mysterious dark elf's three ambushes (assassins, snipers, wizards and a lord, each slain one of
# its kind), the sentries' words, Kristina's letter for Sorius; then Bandellos takes the statue
# for the Mark of Healer; then relog.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q226_test_of_the_healer.golden
character Healer 39
class 15
hold 57 150000
script quest.Q226_TestOfTheHealer
